{"text": "WHILE YOU WERE OUT        Tues 3/10  2:40 pm\nFor: Kenji\nCaller: Dolores Featherstone (Featherstone Orchards)\nPhone: 509 555-0118, before 6\n\nHer husband passed Feb. 27. Needs to know if she signs the joint\nreturn alone and whether Form 1310 applies. IRS letter says they owe\n$6,214; she can pay half now. His SSN ends -7758. K-1 from\nthe orchard not in yet. Call back, she's upset. -- jm", "kind": "Text file", "detail": "68 words", "notes": [], "names": {"people": ["Kenji", "Dolores Featherstone", "jm"], "companies": ["Featherstone Orchards"]}, "chunks": 1, "chunkErrors": 0, "importMs": 0.09999999962747097, "modelMs": 8414.300000000745, "detectors": ["email", "url", "ip", "iban", "card", "card_exp", "cvv", "ssn", "bn_ca", "sin_ca", "ein", "passport_dl", "routing", "phone", "record", "vin", "account", "money", "dob", "age90", "date", "street", "zip", "postal_ca", "names"], "detections": [{"start": 50, "end": 55, "text": "Kenji", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Kenji"}, {"start": 64, "end": 84, "text": "Dolores Featherstone", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "Dolores Featherstone"}, {"start": 86, "end": 107, "text": "Featherstone Orchards", "kind": "company", "source": "model", "canonical": "Featherstone Orchards"}, {"start": 116, "end": 128, "text": "509 555-0118", "kind": "phone", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "509 555-0118"}, {"start": 159, "end": 166, "text": "Feb. 27", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Feb. 27"}, {"start": 274, "end": 280, "text": "$6,214", "kind": "money", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "$6,214"}, {"start": 384, "end": 386, "text": "jm", "kind": "person", "source": "model", "canonical": "jm"}], "patternOnly": [{"start": 116, "end": 128, "text": "509 555-0118", "kind": "phone", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "509 555-0118"}, {"start": 159, "end": 166, "text": "Feb. 27", "kind": "date", "source": "pattern", "canonical": "Feb. 27"}, {"start": 274, "end": 280, "text": "$6,2